  "notes": "{襲|おそ}う is a transitive godan verb meaning to attack, assault, or strike.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ for the target: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{襲|おそ}う\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Physical attacks: ⟦{敵|てき}→敵：03546_teki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{襲|おそ}う (attack the enemy)\n2. Natural disasters: ⟦{台風|たいふう}→台風：01455_taifuu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{町|まち}→町：00613_machi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{襲|おそ}う (typhoon strikes the town)\n3. Emotions/feelings: ⟦{不安|ふあん}→不安：00836_fuan⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{襲|おそ}う (anxiety strikes)\n\nPASSIVE FORM (COMMON):\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{襲|おそ}われる: to be attacked/struck by X\n- ⟦{眠気|ねむけ}→眠気：06534_nemuke⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{襲|おそ}われる: to be overcome by drowsiness\n- ⟦{恐怖|きょうふ}→恐怖：02585_kyoufu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{襲|おそ}われる: to be seized by fear\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{襲撃|しゅうげき}→襲撃：14127_shuugeki⟧: attack, raid (noun)\n- ⟦{奇襲|きしゅう}→奇襲：12193_kishuu⟧: surprise attack",
